  "method": "Lög um kílómetragjald á ökutæki nr. 100/2025, in Alþingi's lagasafn útgáfa 157b (20. apríl 2026): 6. gr., ISK per km by the vehicle's gjaldþyngd, its permissible total weight on registration; from 10,000 kg at most the annex's maximum by axles (motor vehicle 18,000, 26,000, 32,000 kg with 2, 3, 4 or more axles; trailer 10,000, 18,000, 24,000 kg with 1, 2, 3 or more). The motor vehicle and the trailer each pay on their own (give motor_mass_kg, trailer_mass_kg and motor_axles); the annex's maxima for road trains are not applied. Temporary provisions VI and VII for 2028-2029: trucks of 10,000 kg or more running on methane, methanol, electricity or hydrogen, and their trailers, at 20 %. Buses' discounts are left out. Foreign vehicles in Iceland pay it too (3. gr.).",
